  "_comment": [
    "SETUP:",
    "1. This workflow handles: Stock Ledger Report \u2014 actual production, dispatch, closing stock per item.",
    "2. Source file pattern: Stock_Ledger_Report_*.xlsx",
    "3. Replace PASTE_YOUR_SOP_SHEET_ID in both Sheet nodes with the Google Sheet ID",
    "4. The sheet must have a tab named exactly: DPR",
    "5. Webhook URL: https://jollyclamps.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/sop-dpr",
    "6. Env var in /root/.env: JCLP_SOP_DPR_WEBHOOK",
    "7. Credential: Google Sheets \u2014 JCPL (cTdqRAEN5iDJTYQk)",
    "",
    "CHUNKING:",
    "- Django sends large files in chunks of 2,000 rows each.",
    "- First chunk (action='replace'): clears the tab, then appends rows.",
    "- Subsequent chunks (action='append'): appends rows only (no clear).",
    "- The If node routes chunk 0 through Clear, others skip it.",
    "",
    "APPEND1 AUTO-TRIGGER:",
    "After writing source data, triggers Apps Script web app to recompute Append1.",
    "Apps Script URL: https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzxHpNI6VqqlG1jGYWW874w09c64QMpOTCrgCjJUY3AKSf8mEqfQPpqXlVZhBUkrou8/exec"
  ]
